      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHARLIE SEBASTIAN (1) is in good form at present. Finished second at his latest appearance over 1690m at Maryborough, beaten a nose. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Leading hope based on recent form. ALLTHINGS MENACING (11) finished third last start, beaten 5 metres at this track over 1609m. Capable of playing a major role so has to be respected. DIAMOND CHIPP (10) was in the money two starts ago then things went wrong last start when he broke and finished 40 metres away in seventh over 1720m at Melton. Not drawn to best so may need a 10/10 drive. Meets a similar line up so if he behaves a big run is likely. TWIGSTAR (6) is a two-year-old filly by Poster Boy from All Major on debut. Placed in a recent trial. Sure to prove very hard to beat.",
